# Cheshbon Analyzer — Core Rules

Read `docs/for-ai-agents.md` before non-trivial changes.

## Two analysis flows (never merge)

- `/analyze/*` → **client-side only**, files stay in browser
- `/cases/*` → **server-side**, auth required, stored in Postgres

## Stack gotchas

- **Next.js 16** — check `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`; async `params` as Promise
- **Prisma lazy proxy** — `src/lib/db/prisma.ts`; use `isDatabaseConfigured()` in APIs
- **Auth split** — `auth.config.ts` (middleware) vs `auth.ts` (Credentials + adapter)

## i18n (mandatory for UI copy)

Add **both** `he` and `en` in `src/lib/i18n/translations.ts`. Never hardcode user-facing strings.

## New analyzer checklist

1. `src/lib/analyzers/<id>.ts`
2. Register in `registry.ts`
3. Translations in `translations.ts`
4. E2E smoke test (see `e2e-required` rule)

## Scope

Minimal diffs. Match existing patterns. Commit only when user asks.
